  mkNote: "Monthly averages of Dalian futures, converted at FRED monthly USD/CNY, to Oct 2026; Dalian prices include China's 13% VAT. LLDPE and PVC are the competing packaging resins; PET is shown for rigid packs. Crude oil and natural gas set feedstock costs for the naphtha and gas routes. There is no free series for propane in the monthly set, so the PDH spread uses Aramco's monthly contract price.",
  curveTip: v => `¥${f0(v)} · $${f0(v / D.fx.usdcny)}/t`,
